// Ch8 B18 "The cut rope" (act1_ch08.md §2 B18; W26 → W27). In-engine, 18:30, `ch08_aftermath`: the
// storm has gone on along the coast, moving against the wind; the rain is easing and the low town is a
// black lake to the eaves. On the surviving wall-head the Stillguard are counting.
// A Stillguard officer comes to Liss's hoist with a hatchet: two blows, and the rope goes slack and
// slides down the wall face. NOBODY THANKS ANYONE (ADR 0017 (c)). Toma opens his mouth and shuts it: it
// is his order's law, and his faith is intact (Act I). Liss coils what's left, narrating the work
// instead of the grief (her tell). W27: Toma goes along the shield-line asking after a name; a
// Stillguard shakes his head; Toma keeps walking (Ch9's side scene pays it). Kerrid stands at the head
// of the drowned stair looking down; when Rhen looks back he is gone (down into the low town to bring up
// the drowned at slack water: Ch9's cutaway). The chapter ends on the black water and corrow_aftermath.
// Sets ch08_hoist_cut_down (Ch9 reads it for Liss's bark).
title: ch08_cut_rope
location: ch08/corrow
---
@camera W26
@mark kerrid way_stair_flight2_foot walk via=way_approach_top,way_stair_head_w
@music corrow_aftermath fade=3.0
@sfx rain_easing
@wait 3.0
@mark officer hoist_officer walk
Stillguard [cold]: Cut it down. It is bolted into the Watchers. #line:ch08_cut_rope_001
@anim officer hatchet_blow
@sfx hatchet_rope
@wait 0.8
@anim officer hatchet_blow
@wait 0.6
<<set $ch08_hoist_cut_down = true>>
@anim toma look_at officer
@wait 1.2
@anim toma look_away
@wait 1.0
@mark liss liss_coil walk
@anim liss coil_rope
Liss [neutral]: Good rope. Seated true. She held. #line:ch08_cut_rope_002
Rhen [sad]: Liss— #line:ch08_cut_rope_003
Liss [cold]: Don't. #line:ch08_cut_rope_004
@camera W27
@mark toma shield_line_walk walk
Toma [worried]: Brannick? Has anyone seen Ivo Brannick? #line:ch08_cut_rope_005
@anim stillguard_a shake_head
@wait 1.0
@mark toma shield_line_end walk
@wait 2.0
@anim rhen look_at drowned_stair
@camera W25_empty
@wait 2.0
@camera W26
@wait 3.0
@fade out 2.0
===
